<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Truck sees competition pressuring prices.</title>
<headline>Volvo Truck sees competition pressuring prices.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Wednesday tougher competition would put pressure on truck prices in 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;The tougher competition in Europe will lead to more price pressure,&quot; Volvo Truck's managing director Karl-Erling Trogen told a news conference.</p>
<p>Volvo is meeting this with a broader range of products on offer.</p>
<p>&quot;This includes our new FLC series and more news is coming,&quot; Trogen said.</p>
<p>&quot;Among other things we will get costs down for bought material.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
